{%- comment -%}
  UNIX — Judge.me star rating on product cards.

  Uses Judge.me's own preview-badge markup. The metafield renders the stars
  server-side so they appear instantly and are visible to crawlers; the
  wrapper classes let Judge.me's script fill the badge in for products whose
  metafield has not synced yet. Products with no reviews render nothing,
  which is deliberate: an empty five-star row reads worse than no row at all.

  Accepts:
  - card_product: {Object} the product being rendered
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if card_product.metafields.judgeme.badge != blank -%}
  <div class='jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge unix-card-stars' data-id='{{ card_product.id }}'>
    {{ card_product.metafields.judgeme.badge }}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
